@startuml
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #176C78
skinparam LineColor #176C78
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F1F7F8
skinparam classBorderColor #176C78
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F1F7F8
skinparam componentBorderColor #176C78
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFB
skinparam packageBorderColor #819BA3
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF4DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BC8B39
skinparam NoteFontSize 15
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F7F8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #176C78
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #819BA3
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
hide footbox
title Interactive sign-in and secure storage
actor User as U
participant "Home\n_login()" as H
participant "FlutterAppAuth\n+ TIDAL sign-in" as F
participant "TidalAuthService" as A
participant "TidalSessionStore" as S
U -> H : Sign in in the lab / via the start action
H -> F : authorizeAndExchangeCode(request)
note over H,F : clientId, redirectUrl, user.read, collection.read\nNo user credentials in the app code.
alt Sign-in successful
 F --> H : Access token, refresh token?, expiry time?
 H -> A : acceptLogin(TidalSession)
 A -> A : restore(); _epoch++; set _session
 A -> S : write(JSON with version, clientId, session)
 S --> A : Completed or storage error
 A -->> H : notifyListeners()
 A --> H : Future<void> completed
 H -> H : Update status; enable interaction
 opt Library exists in RAM
  H ->> H : Start background synchronization
 end
else Cancelled / platform error
 F --> H : Exception
 H -> H : Keep the existing session\nshow a clear status message
end
note over A,S
 A storage error sets storageWarning.
 The session may work in RAM without being persistently stored.
end note
@enduml
